<SiteLayout title="Systems &amp; AI Automation Services" description="A great lead can still be lost when follow-up is slow or information lives in different tools. We build connected CRM pipelines, notifications, nurturing w" path="/crm-automation/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">04 / SYSTEMS &amp; AI AUTOMATION</p><h1>Smarter systems. Built around your business.</h1><p class="lf-lede">A great lead can still be lost when follow-up is slow or information lives in different tools. We connect CRM platforms, lead management, follow-up automation, AI-powered workflows and custom integrations to help teams respond consistently.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your goals <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHY IT MATTERS</span><strong>Connected business systems, AI-powered workflows and custom integrations designed around your needs.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<CrmShowcase />
<WorkflowCanvas />

<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE CAPABILITIES</p><h2>What we can help you build.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>CRM setup &amp; pipelines</h3><p>Organize lead stages, ownership, tasks and activity so your team can see what needs attention.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Follow-up automation</h3><p>Configure opt-in-aligned emails, SMS, reminders and internal notifications based on meaningful events.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>APIs &amp; custom tools</h3><p>Use APIs, webhooks and custom development to connect forms, calendars, lead sources and internal processes.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Clear steps.<br />Connected execution.</h2><p>The right automation makes human follow-up easier.</p></div><ol class="lf-process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Audit</h3><p>Map where leads arrive and where delays or handoff gaps occur.</p></div></li>
<li><span>02</span><div><h3>Architect</h3><p>Define stages, triggers, permissions and consent requirements.</p></div></li>
<li><span>03</span><div><h3>Implement</h3><p>Configure or code the appropriate CRM and automation workflows.</p></div></li>
<li><span>04</span><div><h3>Validate</h3><p>Test event handling, routing, error cases and reporting.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Questions worth asking.</h2></div><div class="lf-faq-list"><details><summary>Is this limited to GoHighLevel?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. We work with platforms such as HubSpot, GoHighLevel, Salesforce, Pipedrive, n8n, Make and Zapier, as well as custom APIs and software. We recommend the tools that best fit your requirements.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can automation replace our sales team?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Automation can remove repetitive work and improve response times, but human conversations and good sales judgment still matter.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you connect our existing tools?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Potentially. We first confirm each platform’s supported integrations, API permissions and data requirements.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">CONNECTED SERVICES</p><h2>Better together.</h2></div><div class="lf-related"><a class="lf-related-link" href="/websites-funnels/"><span>Lead Generation Websites &amp; Funnels</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
